Ethereum's annual ecosystem review for 2025 highlights key milestones:

🔵 DeFi transaction volumes surged past $99 billion;

🔵 Stablecoin settlement activity hit a staggering $18.8 trillion;

🔵 Layer 2 fees dipped under $0.01 per transaction;

🔵 L2 networks averaged over 5,600 transactions per second;

🔵 Spot ETFs and institutional reserves amassed more than $35 billion worth of ETH;

🔵 Real-world asset (RWA) tokenization on the chain topped $12 billion.

Over 88 million smart contracts were launched across the Ethereum network in total. $ETH #ETH  $ETH 
